// Go workspace tying the app, its installer operator, and the forge client they
// share, so editor tooling spans all three. Each is its own module on purpose:
// controller-runtime's k8s.io/* tree must not constrain the app's KubeVirt/Argo
// client versions, and the operator must not build against the app module.
// The relative replaces in go.mod resolve pkg/forge without the workspace, which
// is how the images build (GOWORK=off) and why ./... at the root skips the
// operator and pkg/forge.
go 1.27.3

use (
	.
	./operator
	./pkg/forge
)
